Homepage: https://github.com/hugomonizdorego/Eduka-Desktop
Description: Edukasaun OS desktop: start menu, panel and settings on LXQt
 Eduka-Desktop is the desktop of Edukasaun OS (Debian stable with LXQt):
  * Eduka-Desktop, the start menu with categories, search and favourites;
  * Eduka-Quick, a round quick launcher (pie menu) on Super+Q;
  * Eduka-Panel with the task bar, the Action Center (calendar, weather,
    time sync, sound, brightness, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth and drives) and the
    notifications;
  * Eduka-Settings with an overview of all settings: user accounts,
    themes, fonts, date and time, the panel, the wallpaper, keyboard,
    mouse, touchpad and touch screen, accessibility, fingerprint login,
    the SDDM and LightDM login screens, privacy and Parental Control;
  * seven desktop themes that also style GTK 2/3/4 and Qt programs and
    the Openbox and xfwm4 window borders, an SDDM login screen theme and
    Edukasaun themes for slick-greeter and lightdm-gtk-greeter.
 .
 It runs inside an LXQt session (startlxqt) with Openbox or xfwm4 and,
 when the computer can, the picom compositor. Eduka-Panel replaces
 lxqt-panel; LXQt provides the session, the file manager and its tools.
 .
 This is version 0.11 RC2 (release candidate 2).
